{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-8-16","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：平方与整数","englishTitle":"If a square number do not measure a square number, neither will the side measure the side; and, if the side do not measure the side, neither will the square measure the square.","book":8,"number":16,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:8.prop.16","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:8.prop.16/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":16,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-8-16@raw-f002d63eb0f7f9c3","contentId":"euclid-8-16","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f002d63eb0f7f9c39bb6b94564f5681bb1e426d4a23893bcb171f236341cbdf9","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-8-16.statement","euclid-8-16.construction.1","euclid-8-16.proof.1","euclid-8-16.proof.2","euclid-8-16.proof.3","euclid-8-16.proof.4","euclid-8-16.conclusion","euclid-8-16.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-8-16.statement","contentId":"euclid-8-16","revisionId":"euclid-8-16@raw-f002d63eb0f7f9c3","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"02f52cc648bf5c8c8f0b6e89ff50a0db802f8f2944199a031d312f5a778bf9f9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If a square number do not measure a square number, neither will the side measure the side; and, if the side do not measure the side, neither will the square measure the square."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果平方数分之一不能达到整除分之一平方数分,整除分一方也不能达到整除分之一;如果平方数分之一不能达到平方数分之一平方数分之一平方数分之一。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-16.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-8-16","revisionId":"euclid-8-16@raw-f002d63eb0f7f9c3","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"827b7db948e4a21a0a4084f5dc0901b7c1815ac92bb5eb06cb544fa3884cb5e6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let A, B be square numbers, and let C, D be their sides; and let A not measure B; I say that neither does C measure D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让A,B成为平方数,让C,D成为它们的一面;让A而不是整除,B;我说C,整除,D也是这样。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-16.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-8-16","revisionId":"euclid-8-16@raw-f002d63eb0f7f9c3","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"eb15a808b02b899c0efeab4392eecd4c644ee6b719c0c6e6da29746860f686dc","citations":["euclid-8-14"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, if C measures D, A will also measure B. [[VIII. 14](/principles/euclid-8-14)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果C 整除 D,A 也整除 B的话 [[VIII. 14](/principles/euclid-8-14)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-16.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-8-16","revisionId":"euclid-8-16@raw-f002d63eb0f7f9c3","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8d3b6e7d36554d6bb4f091de4fd075022c9cbf4794d7d3acca7498261129fc27","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But A does not measure B; therefore neither will C measure D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但A不是整除 B,因此C 整除 D也不可能。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-16.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-8-16","revisionId":"euclid-8-16@raw-f002d63eb0f7f9c3","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"812c223087a48df76a9e4d61d828b00755ae1050f35952c3b2a43fbe97b93f4c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, let C not measure D; I say that neither will A measure B."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,让C而不是整除 D;我说A 整除 B也不会。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-16.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-8-16","revisionId":"euclid-8-16@raw-f002d63eb0f7f9c3","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"27736e5bccff48d04b828af8159bedd849673c8286d9c67142d998fe7d44eb50","citations":["euclid-8-14"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, if A measures B, C will also measure D. [[VIII. 14](/principles/euclid-8-14)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果A 整除 B,C 也整除 D的话 [[VIII. 14](/principles/euclid-8-14)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-16.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-8-16","revisionId":"euclid-8-16@raw-f002d63eb0f7f9c3","order":6,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e233b763c29b383508d8dad8fa9f225bf3657b5839e1cbb708a02145c753625f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But C does not measure D; therefore neither will A measure B. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但C没有整除 D,因此,A 整除 B. 证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-16.source","contentId":"euclid-8-16","revisionId":"euclid-8-16@raw-f002d63eb0f7f9c3","order":7,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"64cc1b75e47b1f2c4e8ca21aa0dd1c22eb5c3ec5c8a570c80538f5ce460cac01","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text"